    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to talk about \"coping mechanisms\" but nothing i do helps. nothing changes, nothing gets easier. it just feels like i'm just waiting for a relief that's never coming. it feels more like an escape than a solution, but it's the only thing that actually sounds peaceful. like, if i could just exit everything, wouldn't that be more logical than just struggling forever?",
